# Hashed/version-pinned filenames never change at the same URL — safe to
# cache forever. HTML is deliberately left out; it should keep revalidating
# since post content changes.
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Baseline security headers, site-wide. No Content-Security-Policy here —
# the site has several legitimate inline scripts (no-flash theme script in
# BaseHead.astro, ThemeToggle.astro, the code-block copy button in
# PostLayout.astro, JSON-LD structured data) that a real CSP needs
# nonces/hashes for. That's a deliberate follow-up pass, not bundled here.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=()
